{"id":"n62497-4-9","stage":1,"title":"가늘다 · 微弱","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62497-4-9-1","ko":"빛이 너무 가늘어서 글씨가 잘 안 보여.","zh":"光线太暗了，字看不清楚。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"빛이","meaning":"光，光线","explanation":"빛：光，光线；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"빛","audio":"/audio/bcfe8128a79515eee12a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62079","senseId":"1","lemma":"빛","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"빛이","audio":"/audio/c68adcdf92b4f013d4ea.mp3"}},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}},{"text":"가늘어서","meaning":"微弱，轻微","explanation":"가늘다：微弱，轻微；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"가늘다","audio":"/audio/9d52ccb4e6d8d6ae8b49.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62497","senseId":"4","lemma":"가늘다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가늘어서","audio":"/audio/b047fe1c3cafb2b4f33f.mp3"}},{"text":"글씨가","meaning":"字体，字迹，笔迹","explanation":"글씨：字体，字迹，笔迹；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"글씨","audio":"/audio/510fc81ede633cdb436d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60239","senseId":"1","lemma":"글씨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"글씨가","audio":"/audio/030f21a5f7736b954e42.mp3"}},{"text":"잘","meaning":"容易","explanation":"잘：容易","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"14","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","